  "creator": "NHS",
  "description": "Four short mobility stretches from the NHS: neck rotations, neck stretches, sideways bends and a calf stretch, 3 each side with holds of 2 to 5 seconds. It takes only a few minutes and is written for older adults but suits anyone stiff from sitting. Do it daily alongside the balance and strength sets.",
